sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as React UI
    participant Router as surge-router
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    User->>UI: Double click or retry
    UI->>Router: Request with same idempotency key
    Router->>DB: Lookup idempotency key
    alt Response already stored
        DB-->>Router: Original response
        Router-->>UI: Replay same response
    else First request
        Router->>DB: Allocate under lock
        DB-->>Router: Store response
        Router-->>UI: Confirmed or queued
    end
    Router->>DB: Unique active registration protects duplicate user state
